Source: pg-synonym
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/Mazuco/pg_synonym

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-synonym
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pg-synonym
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Automatically maintained table and view synonyms for PostgreSQL
 pg_synonym provides synonyms backed by security-invoker views and event
 triggers that keep them in sync with changes to their target relations.
